[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18122.15, "timestamp": "05:02:02", "text": "再次。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18124.39, "timestamp": "05:02:04", "text": "我的天啊。明天就是星期天了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18128.31, "timestamp": "05:02:08", "text": "所以，你是房东，而且还有一些其他问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18131.03, "timestamp": "05:02:11", "text": "节日也像一些香蒜酱节一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18133.19, "timestamp": "05:02:13", "text": "或者发生了什么事。所以，她给了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18135.75, "timestamp": "05:02:15", "text": "就像是买印度香饭的优惠券一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18138.868, "timestamp": "05:02:18", "text": "她叫我过去吃印度香饭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18143.75, "timestamp": "05:02:23", "text": "我的天啊。伙计们，来份印度香饭吧。我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18145.67, "timestamp": "05:02:25", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18148.23, "timestamp": "05:02:28", "text": "好的。顺便问一下，这是什么类型的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18149.75, "timestamp": "05:02:29", "text": "你们那里有印度香饭吗？是这样的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18153.19, "timestamp": "05:02:33", "text": "是巴斯马蒂米还是那种奇怪的海桑巴？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18155.19, "timestamp": "05:02:35", "text": "我不知道。我觉得最像巴斯马蒂米。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18157.622, "timestamp": "05:02:37", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Joq's Activity State is Midnight-Snacking"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18157.99, "timestamp": "05:02:37", "text": "当时的情况就是这样，对吧？是的，我们有这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18161.83, "timestamp": "05:02:41", "text": "这里有一种奇怪的海参，真是愚蠢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18166.41, "timestamp": "05:02:46", "text": "哦，它从来就不好吃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18168.628, "timestamp": "05:02:48", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18171.67, "timestamp": "05:02:51", "text": "嘿，巴斯马蒂米饭是什么味道？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18173.83, "timestamp": "05:02:53", "text": "喜欢？我忘了那是什么味道了。巴斯马蒂大米"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18176.31, "timestamp": "05:02:56", "text": "就像面条一样，像米饭一样，像长条状的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18179.27, "timestamp": "05:02:59", "text": "米。啊，不。是的。是的。是的。这"}]